h/MathML\"><mn>80</mn><mi>kPa</mi></math>, then the amount of heat transferred is __________J."}, "options": [{"id": "f113ae", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f9b2ee0e063d92a80d3"}, {"id": "9f1386", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f9b2ee0e063d92a80d4"}, {"id": "f81e83", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f9b2ee0e063d92a80d5"}, {"id": "5c0e6c", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f9b2ee0e063d92a80d6"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f9b2ee0e063d92a80d7", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60c9e849ea076dc381c0df8c"], "topics": ["60e2fb2066f9ce3f243b4b70"], "concepts": ["6117b8e067dbe2603c3e8ad2"], "question": {"text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math> of heat is required to melt one mole of sodium chloride and the entropy change at the melting point is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>28</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>atm</mi></math>. The melting point of sodium chloride is _______ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> (Nearest Integer)"}, "options": [{"id": "7fe499", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f9b2ee0e063d92a80d8"}, {"id": "f6a7db", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f9b2ee0e063d92a80d9"}, {"id": "7a9ac5", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f9b2ee0e063d92a80da"}, {"id": "d3f6e4", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f9b2ee0e063d92a80db"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f9b2ee0e063d92a80dc", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60c9e849ea076dc381c0df8c"], "topics": ["60e5671c499d1e49588f8808"], "concepts": ["60e56